#: data/event_scripts.s:1362
msgctxt "gText_PokemartSign"
msgid ""
"“Selected items for your convenience!”\n"
"POKéMON MART$"
msgstr ""
"“精选好物，方便你的旅途！”\n"
"友好商店$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1366
msgctxt "gText_PokemonCenterSign"
msgid ""
"“Rejuvenate your tired partners!”\n"
"POKéMON CENTER$"
msgstr ""
"“让疲惫的伙伴恢复活力！”\n"
"宝可梦中心$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1370
msgctxt "gText_MomOrDadMightLikeThisProgram"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} might like this program.\n"
"… … … … … … … … … … … … … … … …\p"
"Better get going!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}可能会喜欢这个节目。\n"
"…… …… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"该出发了！$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1375
msgctxt "gText_WhichFloorWouldYouLike"
msgid ""
"Welcome to LILYCOVE DEPARTMENT STORE.\p"
"Which floor would you like?$"
msgstr ""
"欢迎光临水静百货商店。\p"
"请问要去几楼？$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1379
msgctxt "gText_SandstormIsVicious"
msgid ""
"The sandstorm is vicious.\n"
"It's impossible to keep going.$"
msgstr ""
"沙暴太猛烈了。\n"
"根本无法继续前进。$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1383
msgctxt "gText_SelectWithoutRegisteredItem"
msgid ""
"An item in the BAG can be\n"
"registered to SELECT for easy use.$"
msgstr ""
"可以把背包里的道具登录到\n"
"SELECT键，方便使用。$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1387
msgctxt "gText_PokemonTrainerSchoolEmail"
msgid ""
"There's an e-mail from POKéMON TRAINER\n"
"SCHOOL.\p"
"… … … … … …\p"
"A POKéMON may learn up to four moves.\p"
"A TRAINER's expertise is tested on the\n"
"move sets chosen for POKéMON.\p"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""
"收到了一封来自\n"
"宝可梦训练家学校的电子邮件。\p"
"…… …… ……\p"
"宝可梦最多可以学会4个招式。\p"
"为宝可梦选择怎样的招式组合，\n"
"正考验着训练家的实力。\p"
"…… …… ……$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1396
msgctxt "gText_PlayerHouseBootPC"
msgid "{PLAYER} booted up the PC.$"
msgstr "{PLAYER}打开了电脑。$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1399
msgctxt "gText_PokeblockLinkCanceled"
msgid "The link was canceled.$"
msgstr "连接已取消。$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1402
msgctxt "gText_UnusedNicknameReceivedPokemon"
msgid ""
"Want to give a nickname to\n"
"the {STR_VAR_2} you received?$"
msgstr ""
"要给收到的{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"取个昵称吗？$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1406
msgctxt "gText_PlayerWhitedOut"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} is out of usable\n"
"POKéMON!\p"
"{PLAYER} whited out!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}已经没有\n"
"可以战斗的宝可梦了！\p"
"{PLAYER}眼前变得一片漆黑！$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1410
msgctxt "gText_FirstShouldRestoreMonsHealth"
msgid ""
"First, you should restore your\n"
"POKéMON to full health.$"
msgstr ""
"首先，应该让你的\n"
"宝可梦恢复健康。$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1414
msgctxt "gText_MonsHealedShouldBuyPotions"
msgid ""
"Your POKéMON have been healed\n"
"to perfect health.\p"
"If your POKéMON's energy, HP,\n"
"is down, please come see us.\p"
"If you're planning to go far in the\n"
"field, you should buy some POTIONS\l"
"at the POKéMON MART.\p"
"We hope you excel!$"
msgstr ""
"你的宝可梦已经\n"
"完全恢复健康了。\p"
"如果宝可梦的体力，也就是HP\n"
"减少了，就请来找我们。\p"
"如果你打算去很远的地方，\n"
"最好先在友好商店\l"
"买一些伤药。\p"
"祝你一切顺利！$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1424
msgctxt "gText_MonsHealed"
msgid ""
"Your POKéMON have been healed\n"
"to perfect health.\p"
"We hope you excel!$"
msgstr ""
"你的宝可梦已经\n"
"完全恢复健康了。\p"
"祝你一切顺利！$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1429
msgctxt "gText_HadQuiteAnExperienceTakeRest"
msgid ""
"MOM: {PLAYER}!\n"
"Welcome home.\p"
"It sounds like you had quite\n"
"an experience.\p"
"Maybe you should take a quick\n"
"rest.$"
msgstr ""
"妈妈：{PLAYER}！\n"
"欢迎回家。\p"
"看来你经历了不少事呢。\p"
"要不要稍微\n"
"休息一下？$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1437
msgctxt "gText_MomExplainHPGetPotions"
msgid ""
"MOM: Oh, good! You and your\n"
"POKéMON are looking great.\p"
"I just heard from {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"He said that POKéMON's energy is\n"
"measured in HP.\p"
"If your POKéMON lose their HP,\n"
"you can restore them at any\l"
"POKéMON CENTER.\p"
"If you're going to travel far away,\n"
"the smart TRAINER stocks up on\l"
"POTIONS at the POKéMON MART.\p"
"Make me proud, honey!\p"
"Take care!$"
msgstr ""
"妈妈：哎呀，太好了！你和\n"
"宝可梦看起来都很精神。\p"
"我刚听{STR_VAR_1}说了。\p"
"他说宝可梦的体力\n"
"是用HP来衡量的。\p"
"如果宝可梦的HP减少了，\n"
"可以去任何一家\l"
"宝可梦中心恢复。\p"
"如果要出远门，聪明的训练家\n"
"会先在友好商店备好伤药。\p"
"要让我为你骄傲哦，宝贝！\p"
"路上小心！$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1452
msgctxt "gText_RegisteredTrainerinPokeNav"
msgid ""
"Registered {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""
"在宝可梦导航中登录了\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}。$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1456
msgctxt "gText_ComeBackWithSecretPower"
msgid ""
"Do you know the TM SECRET POWER?\p"
"Our group, we love the TM SECRET\n"
"POWER.\p"
"One of our members will give it to you.\n"
"Come back and show me if you get it.\p"
"We'll accept you as a member and sell\n"
"you good stuff in secrecy.$"
msgstr ""
"你知道招式学习器“秘密之力”吗？\p"
"我们这个团体，最喜欢\n"
"招式学习器“秘密之力”了。\p"
"我们的一位成员会把它送给你。\n"
"拿到之后再来给我看看吧。\p"
"我们会接纳你成为成员，\n"
"偷偷卖给你好东西。$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1465
msgctxt "gText_PokerusExplanation"
msgid ""
"Your POKéMON may be infected with\n"
"POKéRUS.\p"
"Little is known about the POKéRUS\n"
"except that they are microscopic life-\l"
"forms that attach to POKéMON.\p"
"While infected, POKéMON are said to\n"
"grow exceptionally well.$"
msgstr ""
"你的宝可梦可能感染了\n"
"宝可病毒。\p"
"关于宝可病毒，人们只知道\n"
"它是一种会附着在宝可梦身上的\l"
"微小生物。\p"
"据说宝可梦在感染期间\n"
"会成长得特别好。$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1476
msgctxt "gText_DoorOpenedFarAway"
msgid ""
"It sounded as if a door opened\n"
"somewhere far away.$"
msgstr ""
"好像从很远的地方\n"
"传来了开门的声音。$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1480
msgctxt "gText_BigHoleInTheWall"
msgid "There is a big hole in the wall.$"
msgstr "墙上有一个大洞。$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1483
msgctxt "gText_SorryWirelessClubAdjustments"
msgid ""
"I'm terribly sorry.\n"
"The POKéMON WIRELESS CLUB is\l"
"undergoing adjustments now.$"
msgstr ""
"非常抱歉。\n"
"宝可梦无线俱乐部\l"
"目前正在调整中。$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1488
msgctxt "gText_UndergoingAdjustments"
msgid ""
"It appears to be undergoing\n"
"adjustments…$"
msgstr ""
"好像正在\n"
"调整中……$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1493
msgctxt "gText_SorryTradeCenterInspections"
msgid ""
"I'm terribly sorry. The TRADE CENTER\n"
"is undergoing inspections.$"
msgstr ""
"非常抱歉。\n"
"交换中心正在检修中。$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1498
msgctxt "gText_SorryRecordCornerPreparation"
msgid ""
"I'm terribly sorry. The RECORD CORNER\n"
"is under preparation.$"
msgstr ""
"非常抱歉。\n"
"记录角正在准备中。$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1502
msgctxt "gText_PlayerHandedOverTheItem"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} handed over the\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}交出了\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1506
msgctxt "gText_ThankYouForAccessingMysteryGift"
msgid ""
"Thank you for accessing the\n"
"MYSTERY GIFT System.$"
msgstr ""
"感谢你使用\n"
"神秘礼物系统。$"

#: data/event_scripts.s:1510
msgctxt "gText_PlayerFoundOneTMHM"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} found one {STR_VAR_1}\n"
